      "text": "Figure 1: Comparison between (a) performance router which routes queries to different sized models (Small LLM vs Large LLM) to balance cost and latency, and (b) task router which routes queries to domain-specific expert agents (ELB Agent, CDN Agent, DNS Agent) to improve accuracy.",
